{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XLEinkLDZ6kjYxpjtxQ7Bv","type":"tool_result","content":"The Worker size section doesn't mention 3 MB, 10 MB, or any changelog dates. It sets a 64 MiB limit on uncompressed size for both Free and Paid plans. Because each quote must stay under 125 characters, I've split the section into segments:\n\n**Limit:** \"Worker size (uncompressed) | 64 MiB | 64 MiB\"\n\n\"There is no compressed size limit. Only the uncompressed bundle size counts.\"\n\n\"Larger Worker bundles can impact startup time. To check your Worker bundle size:\"\n\nCommand: \"wrangler deploy --outdir bundled/ --dry-run\"\n\nSample output: \"Total Upload: 259.61 KiB / gzip: 47.23 KiB\"\n\n\"The Total Upload value is your uncompressed bundle size.\"\n\n\"The gzip value is shown for reference but is not a limit.\"\n\n**Reduction tips:**\n\n- \"Remove unnecessary dependencies and packages.\"\n- \"Store configuration files, static assets, and binary data in KV, R2, D1, or Workers Static Assets instead of bundling them.\"\n- \"Split functionality across multiple Workers using Service bindings.\"\n\nThe page covers startup time in a separate \"Worker startup time\" section, which says the Worker must parse and execute its global scope within 1 second."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"783694ad-022e-4b65-a1d7-d0e4867e1c79","uuid":"5b736d97-40a2-4f6e-8a23-48f5e0b8c37c","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:18:07.259Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":26152,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The Worker size section doesn't mention 3 MB, 10 MB, or any changelog dates. It sets a 64 MiB limit on uncompressed size for both Free and Paid plans. Because each quote must stay under 125 characters, I've split the section into segments:\n\n**Limit:** \"Worker size (uncompressed) | 64 MiB | 64 MiB\"\n\n\"There is no compressed size limit. Only the uncompressed bundle size counts.\"\n\n\"Larger Worker bundles can impact startup time. To check your Worker bundle size:\"\n\nCommand: \"wrangler deploy --outdir bundled/ --dry-run\"\n\nSample output: \"Total Upload: 259.61 KiB / gzip: 47.23 KiB\"\n\n\"The Total Upload value is your uncompressed bundle size.\"\n\n\"The gzip value is shown for reference but is not a limit.\"\n\n**Reduction tips:**\n\n- \"Remove unnecessary dependencies and packages.\"\n- \"Store configuration files, static assets, and binary data in KV, R2, D1, or Workers Static Assets instead of bundling them.\"\n- \"Split functionality across multiple Workers using Service bindings.\"\n\nThe page covers startup time in a separate \"Worker startup time\" section, which says the Worker must parse and execute its global scope within 1 second.","durationMs":5370,"url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XLEinkLDZ6kjYxpjtxQ7Bv","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfpkq6jgSEdBYmyX4n4iB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No, that has changed. Cloudflare's current Workers limits page sets one limit of **64 MiB uncompressed** for both the Free and Paid plans. It says \"there is no compressed size limit. Only the uncompressed bundle size counts.\" The old 3 MB (Free) and 10 MB (Paid) compressed limits no longer apply.\n\nTo check your size, run `wrangler deploy --outdir bundled/ --dry-run`. The \"Total Upload\" figure is what counts against the limit, and the gzip figure is only for reference. Large bundles can still be a problem because the Worker has to parse and run its global scope within 1 second at startup.\n\nSources:\n- [Cloudflare Workers – Limits](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/platform/limits/)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":670,"cache_read_input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":670},"output_tokens":257,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"783694ad-022e-4b65-a1d7-d0e4867e1c79","uuid":"e0b51826-0f9a-450e-80fb-06a6fc5da315","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:18:10.551Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpkq6TpQVyQuyczwsNU2"}
